          "en": "Weekly days off: Friday and Saturday"
        },
        {
          "bn": "সরকারি ছুটির দিনে অফিস বন্ধ থাকবে।",
          "tr": "shorkari chhutir dine ofis bondho thakbe.",
          "en": "The office is closed on public holidays."
        }
      ],
      "question": "On which days is the office closed every week?",
      "options": [
        "Saturday and Sunday",
        "Only Friday",
        "Only on public holidays",
        "Friday and Saturday"
      ],
      "answer": 3,
      "why": "**সাপ্তাহিক ছুটি** 'weekly days off': Friday and Saturday."
